1
00:00:00,969 --> 00:00:02,129
Penny?

2
00:00:02,637 --> 00:00:06,367
(Penny:)It was a letter explaining that your dad
wasn't who he said he was.

3
00:00:06,541 --> 00:00:08,671
(Penny:)Eventually his other life caught up to him...

4
00:00:08,843 --> 00:00:11,783
(Penny:)...and the only way to keep
you and your mom safe was to leave.

5
00:00:11,946 --> 00:00:13,846
(Sheldon:)I would like to change mine.

6
00:00:16,451 --> 00:00:20,781
(Sheldon:)The pirate's name was Peg-Leg Antoine.

7
00:00:22,190 --> 00:00:25,060
(Sheldon:)Now it's completely different from Goonies.

8
00:00:26,761 --> 00:00:28,521
- No, it's not.
- Don't.

9
00:00:30,031 --> 00:00:31,621
(Leonard:)Okay, my turn.

10
00:00:31,899 --> 00:00:35,129
(Leonard:)Your dad wrote about how family
is the most important thing...

11
00:00:35,303 --> 00:00:37,893
(Leonard:)...and that you should never
throw it away like he did.

12
00:00:39,107 --> 00:00:40,597
(Howard:)Hmm.

13
00:00:40,808 --> 00:00:42,278
Bernadette?

14
00:00:43,878 --> 00:00:48,278
In the envelope was a picture of your dad
holding you the day you were born.

15
00:00:48,483 --> 00:01:02,023
(Bernadette:)On the back he wrote,
"Howard, my son, my greatest gift."

